<title>USA: United Wisconsin Services Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>United Wisconsin Services Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended  Twelve months ended</p>
<p>				   December 31,	 December 31,</p>
<p>				 1996     1995	  1996	1995</p>
<p>		  (In thousands, except share and per share data)</p>
<p> Total revenues	 323,539   274,107   1,163,311 1,038,317</p>
<p> Total expenses	 319,441   272,455   1,146,262 1,028,963</p>
<p> Net income (a)	   2,425     1,590	10,203     6,373</p>
<p>Weighted avg shrs 13,764,216 12,599,715 12,892,431 12,550,601</p>
<p>Earnings per common share:</p>
<p>After-tax earnings, excluding</p>
<p>realized investment gains</p>
<p>				 0.02	0.07	  0.31	0.07</p>
<p>Realized investment gains,</p>
<p>   net of tax		0.16	0.06	  0.48	0.43</p>
<p>Earnings per common share (a)</p>
<p>				 0.18	0.13	  0.79	0.50</p>
<p>(a) Net income for the fourth quarter of 1996 includes an after-tax charge of $2.6 million or $0.19 per common share for one-time charges arising from the accelerated recognition of losses on two discontinued blocks of business and transaction expenses related to the purchase of AMS.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
